message: "If you use paftacular in research, please cite the software using this metadata."
title: "paftacular: Parsing and serializing mzPAF peak annotations"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Patrick T.
    family-names: Garrett
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8434-9693"
    affiliation: Scripps Research Institute
  - given-names: John R.
    family-names: Yates
    name-suffix: III
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5267-1672"
    affiliation: Scripps Research Institute
abstract: >-
  A Python library for parsing, constructing, serializing, and analyzing HUPO
  Proteomics Standards Initiative mzPAF peak annotations, including fragment-ion
  types, modifications, isotopes, adducts, charge states, mass errors,
  confidence scores, and mass and elemental-composition calculations.
keywords:
  - Python
  - Proteomics
  - Mass Spectrometry
  - mzPAF
  - Peak Annotation
  - HUPO-PSI
  - Bioinformatics
